## Shape Gym App - Local Configuration
## Copy this file as 'local.properties' and fill in your Supabase project credentials.
## NOTE: local.properties is git-ignored. NEVER commit your secrets!
## NEVER put your service_role key here; only the anon public key belongs in the client app.

sdk.dir=C:\\Users\\YOUR_USERNAME\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
